title: 밤_5_헬스하기_신아산_영문
---
(I think I've been eating too well lately; I feel like I've gained some weight.)
(Should I hit the gym for a change?)
<<show san_idle_ver2>>
(I see ASan over there, working hard on some forearm exercises with dumbbells.)
<<play san_sound>>
{name()}: You go to this gym too?
ASan: Yep.
ASan: If I want to keep playing the bass standing up for our next performance, working out is a must.
(As she spoke, she continued struggling and straining to lift the dumbbells.)
{name()}: Want me to spot you?
<<if get("lvSan") >= 50>>
    <<jump 밤_5_헬스하기_신아산_호감도o_영문>>
<<else>>
    <<jump 밤_5_헬스하기_신아산_호감도x_영문>>
<<endif>>
===

title: 밤_5_헬스하기_신아산_호감도o_영문
---
<<play 신아산_흠>>
ASan: Huh?
ASan: You're going to help me?
{name()}: I've been watching you from the side, and you look like you're struggling. I'll just spot you.
{name()}: Is that okay?
<<show san_blush_ver2>>
ASan: ........
ASan: If you're going to spot me....
ASan: I'd be glad, of course.
{name()}: Then why don't you come over here?
ASan: .....Okay.
<<change lvSan 5>>
<<like 신아산>>
<<show san_idle_ver2>>
ASan: I'm thankful and all, but it's absolutely NOT because I like you or anything that I'm asking for help!!!!!
<<show san_blush_ver2>>
<<play 신아산_흠>>
ASan: .... Just so you know.
(And so, we worked out together.)
<<end>>
===

title: 밤_5_헬스하기_신아산_호감도x_영문
---
<<show san_neg_ver2>>
<<play 신아산_허>>
ASan: No.
ASan: I'm concentrating really hard on my workout right now, so please refrain from talking to me.
{name()}: Whoa, watch out!!!!!!
(ASan almost got hit by someone else's gym equipment nearby.)
{name()}: Are you okay?
<<show san_blush_ver2>>
ASan: Uh......
ASan: That could have been bad if it wasn't for you....
<<play 신아산_웃음>>
ASan: Thanks.
<<change lvSan 5>>
<<like 신아산>>
{name()}: Then let me help you with your workout.
<<show san_smile>>
ASan: .........Fine.
(And so, we worked out together.)
<<end>>
===